Your quick wit and reflexes allow you to anticipate attacks against you, granting you a [32%, 34%, 35%, 36%, 37% (TL1-5; DEX 100)] chance to evade melee and ranged attacks and [16, 27, 37, 46, 55 (TL1-5; DEX 100)] increased defense for 4 turns.

The chance to evade and defense bonus increase with your Dexterity.
